      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should pivot the narrative from the raw percentage to the *significance* of the 5% gain within the specific ecological context. Frame it as a critical baseline achievement, noting that this 5% represents a statistically significant survival rate in a highly degraded environment, which is a major hurdle. Furthermore, highlight that the project successfully established the scalable framework—the *process*—that will lead to exponential growth with the requested funding.",
